01:13:16.800 --> 01:13:20.992 align:middle line:84%
It doesn't matter, all
pluses, all plus gates.

01:13:20.992 --> 01:13:22.950 align:middle line:84%
Or it actually doesn't
matter, because nobody's

01:13:22.950 --> 01:13:26.080 align:middle line:90%
