01:13:26.080 --> 01:13:28.960 align:middle line:84%
So I guess I'm
saying, each circuit,

01:13:28.960 --> 01:13:34.320 align:middle line:84%
you can describe it with
bit 010101 in some way.

01:13:34.320 --> 01:13:37.650 align:middle line:90%
So put all 0 bits.

01:13:37.650 --> 01:13:40.660 align:middle line:84%
So I don't know if it
even describes a circuit.

01:13:40.660 --> 01:13:42.390 align:middle line:90%
Yeah, Anand.

01:13:42.390 --> 01:13:46.530 align:middle line:84%
