01:14:01.870 --> 01:14:02.540 align:middle line:90%
OK, good.

01:14:02.540 --> 01:14:03.390 align:middle line:90%
No, great question.

01:14:03.390 --> 01:14:04.893 align:middle line:84%
So the question
was the following.

01:14:04.893 --> 01:14:06.060 align:middle line:90%
