gamma, he knows the trapdoor.

01:14:37.045 --> 01:14:40.315 align:middle line:90%


01:14:40.315 --> 01:14:40.870 align:middle line:90%
No.

01:14:40.870 --> 01:14:43.810 align:middle line:84%
But actually, one
second, you're right.

01:14:43.810 --> 01:14:45.430 align:middle line:84%
Under the hood, he
knows the trapdoor.

01:14:45.430 --> 01:14:45.930 align:middle line:90%
Yeah.

01:14:45.930 --> 01:14:49.700 align:middle line:90%
So hold on.

01:14:49.700 --> 01:14:52.460 align:middle line:84%
Yeah, the problem is that, under
the hood, he knows the trapdoor.

01:14:52.460 --> 01:14:58.880 align:middle line:84%
However, I'm not sure actually
that that's a problem.

01:14:58.880 --> 01:15:03.975 align:middle line:84%
