let me think for a second.

01:15:03.975 --> 01:15:07.420 align:middle line:90%


01:15:07.420 --> 01:15:10.370 align:middle line:90%
I think it actually may work.

01:15:10.370 --> 01:15:13.380 align:middle line:84%
So look, it changes
the protocol.

01:15:13.380 --> 01:15:17.470 align:middle line:84%
For example, now, it's no
longer publicly verifiable.

01:15:17.470 --> 01:15:19.810 align:middle line:84%
Now, his message is
encrypted, so you

01:15:19.810 --> 01:15:22.450 align:middle line:84%
