order to learn it.

01:15:22.450 --> 01:15:25.880 align:middle line:90%
So there are issue with this.

01:15:25.880 --> 01:15:29.860 align:middle line:84%
But also, I'll tell
you more than that.

01:15:29.860 --> 01:15:34.870 align:middle line:84%
If, indeed, you put in the
Fiat-Shamir in the actual

01:15:34.870 --> 01:15:35.660 align:middle line:90%
