01:15:35.660 --> 01:15:38.390 align:middle line:84%
you should think of it, the
people who generate Fiat-Shamir,

01:15:38.390 --> 01:15:40.770 align:middle line:84%
they actually don't
know the trapdoor.

01:15:40.770 --> 01:15:43.025 align:middle line:90%
They don't know the trapdoor.

01:15:43.025 --> 01:15:44.400 align:middle line:84%
There's a scheme,
and it's sound.

01:15:44.400 --> 01:15:46.090 align:middle line:84%
And there is a trapdoor,
but nobody knows it.

01:15:46.090 --> 01:15:48.340 align:middle line:84%
And the people, they don't
actually know the trapdoor.

01:15:48.340 --> 01:15:50.160 align:middle line:84%
So in the actual
scheme, there won't be

01:15:50.160 --> 01:15:52.380 align:middle line:90%
