01:16:30.820 --> 01:16:34.450 align:middle line:84%
And now, it seems like I don't
know it seems like that cannot

01:16:34.450 --> 01:16:35.842 align:middle line:90%
work.

01:16:35.842 --> 01:16:38.425 align:middle line:84%
Nevertheless, I'm going to prove
security in, like, two lines.

01:16:38.425 --> 01:16:41.250 align:middle line:90%


01:16:41.250 --> 01:16:43.880 align:middle line:84%
And the proof is
ingenious, really.

01:16:43.880 --> 01:16:47.040 align:middle line:84%
This construction, it's
very tempting to try.

01:16:47.040 --> 01:16:48.110 align:middle line:90%
It just doesn't work.

01:16:48.110 --> 01:16:50.152 align:middle line:84%
When you look at it, it's
like OK, and then what?

01:16:50.152 --> 01:16:52.100 align:middle line:90%
And then what?

01:16:52.100 --> 01:16:53.660 align:middle line:90%
But here's their idea.

01:16:53.660 --> 01:16:54.940 align:middle line:90%
Their idea is following.

01:16:54.940 --> 01:17:01.370 align:middle line:84%
Look, all we need to argue
is that, for every alpha,

01:17:01.370 --> 01:17:04.965 align:middle line:90%
