01:17:04.965 --> 01:17:08.440 align:middle line:90%


01:17:08.440 --> 01:17:09.405 align:middle line:90%
That's all we need.

01:17:09.405 --> 01:17:13.740 align:middle line:90%


01:17:13.740 --> 01:17:18.190 align:middle line:84%
So then in the analysis,
I'm going to say-- so again,

01:17:18.190 --> 01:17:19.745 align:middle line:84%
