01:17:21.870 --> 01:17:22.960 align:middle line:90%
This g is-- I don't care.

01:17:22.960 --> 01:17:25.620 align:middle line:84%
It's like the fixed
circuit, whatever

01:17:25.620 --> 01:17:26.620 align:middle line:90%
