01:18:05.250 --> 01:18:06.420 align:middle line:90%
YAEL T. KALAI: Yeah.

01:18:06.420 --> 01:18:07.410 align:middle line:90%
Sorry, yeah.

01:18:07.410 --> 01:18:08.590 align:middle line:90%
