01:18:08.590 --> 01:18:13.795 align:middle line:84%
This is an encryption with
public key of g alpha.

01:18:13.795 --> 01:18:14.420 align:middle line:90%
AUDIENCE: Yeah.

01:18:14.420 --> 01:18:15.610 align:middle line:90%
YAEL T. KALAI: Yeah, sorry.

01:18:15.610 --> 01:18:16.300 align:middle line:90%
