01:18:17.020 --> 01:18:21.730 align:middle line:90%


01:18:21.730 --> 01:18:23.355 align:middle line:90%
So any idea what--

01:18:23.355 --> 01:18:28.140 align:middle line:90%


01:18:28.140 --> 01:18:29.100 align:middle line:90%
